  current_file: %{path: ..., content: ...},
  related_files: [%{path: ..., summary: ...}],
  recent_turns: [...],
  conversation_summary: "...",
  refs: [...]
}
```

Then later:

- add chunking by line range
- add per-file summaries
- add symbol extraction
- add hashes to invalidate stale summaries
- optionally add embeddings

So yes, your conclusion is correct:

- never append everything
- always select, summarize, and rehydrate

